From 701cace5f0e339d1973c5fa7c678d4d8ab7df778 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksandr Kostenko <sanyokkua@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:48:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] macOS: Settings window (Cmd+,) with the NFSU2 rows

NFS Underground 2 > Settings... in the menu bar SDL makes (Quit is Cmd+Q
there), the same window as the NFS Underground port's: Display and
Resolution Scale (now; the scale is the game's Options > Video row) and
Frame Rate 60/120/30, Gamma, Effects, Draw Distance, Motion Blur (next
start). Kept in settings.ini in the working directory as environment
defaults; set variables win. Replaces the separate launcher window.
